# Template: acceptance. Exceptions only: a case no journey, sequence, or rule
# can show. why_not_diagram says why.
# Required: ready, kind, id, module, title, why_not_diagram,
#   verifies (at least one record), given, when, then.
ready: 1
kind: acceptance
id: notes.acceptance.draft-survives-reload
module: notes
title: An unsaved draft survives a reload
why_not_diagram: >-
  It holds in every editor state rather than at one step, so no single step
  or message can carry it.
verifies:
  - notes.surface.editor
given: A person has typed text in the editor and not saved it
when: The page reloads
then: The editor shows the same text
